>. Category <em>audio</em>.</p>','publish','product','2026-10-13 04:41:39','2026-10-13 04:41:39'),(54,2,'Noise-Cancel Headphones #53','DEMO-053','<p>Demo product for import. SKU <strong>DEMO-053</strong>. Category <em>wearables</em>.</p>','publish','product','2026-10-13 04:41:39','2026-10-13 04:41:39'),(55,2,'Fitness Band #54','DEMO-054','<p>Demo product for import. SKU <strong>DEMO-054</strong>. Category <em>accessories</em>.</p>','publish','product','2026-10-13 04:41:39','2026-10-13 04:41:39'),(56,2,'USB-C Hub #55','DEMO-055','<p>Demo product for import. SKU <strong>DEMO-055</strong>. Category <em>kitchen</em>.</p>','publish','product','2026-10-13 04:41:39','2026-10-13 04:41:39'),(57,2,'About Us','about-us','<h2>Who We Are</h2>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>NestifyTech</strong> — your trusted destination for premium electronics, smart gadgets, and cutting-edge technology products. Founded with a passion for innovation, we connect customers with the latest and greatest in consumer electronics.</p>\n\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<p>Our mission is simple: to make world-class technology accessible to everyone. We curate every product with care, ensuring quality, authenticity, and competitive pricing. Whether you\'re a tech enthusiast, a professional, or buying a gift, NestifyTech has you covered.</p>\n\n<h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>100% Authentic Products</strong> — Every item is sourced directly from authorized manufacturers and distributors.</li>\n  <li><strong>Fast & Reliable Shipping</strong> — We partner with leading courier services to ensure timely delivery.</li>\n  <li><strong>Expert Customer Support</strong> — Our team is available 24/7 to help you with any questions or concerns.</li>\n  <li><strong>Secure Payments</strong> — We use industry-leading encryption to protect your transactions.</li>\n  <li><strong>Easy Returns</strong> — Not satisfied? Our hassle-free 30-day return policy has you covered.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Our Vision</h2>\n<p>We envision a world where innovative technology empowers lives — from the home to the office and everywhere in between. At NestifyTech, we are committed to growing alongside the communities we serve.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(58,2,'Privacy Policy','privacy-policy','<p><em>Last updated: October 13, 2026</em></p>\n\n<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>\n<p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you create an account, place an order, or contact our support team. This may include your name, email address, shipping address, phone number, and payment information.</p>\n\n<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<p>We use the information we collect to:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Process and fulfill your orders</li>\n  <li>Send transactional and promotional communications</li>\n  <li>Improve our website and services</li>\n  <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>\n<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your data with trusted service providers who assist us in operating our website and conducting our business, subject to confidentiality agreements.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Cookies</h2>\n<p>We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, analyze site traffic, and personalize content. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Data Security</h2>\n<p>We implement industry-standard security measures including SSL encryption to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>\n<p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data at any time. Please contact us at <strong>privacy@nestifytech.com</strong> to exercise these rights.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Contact Us</h2>\n<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <strong>privacy@nestifytech.com</strong>.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(59,2,'Terms & Conditions','terms-and-conditions','<p><em>Last updated: October 13, 2026</em></p>\n\n<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>\n<p>By accessing or using the NestifyTech website, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of our services.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Products & Pricing</h2>\n<p>All prices are listed in USD unless otherwise indicated. We reserve the right to change prices at any time without prior notice. Product availability is subject to change.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Orders & Payment</h2>\n<p>By placing an order, you represent that you are of legal age and authorized to use the payment method provided. All orders are subject to acceptance and availability.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Shipping & Delivery</h2>\n<p>Estimated delivery times are provided in good faith but are not guaranteed. NestifyTech is not responsible for delays caused by shipping carriers, customs, or circumstances beyond our control.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Returns & Refunds</h2>\n<p>Our return policy allows returns within 30 days of delivery, provided items are in original condition. See our full Return Policy for details.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<p>All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the property of NestifyTech and may not be reproduced without written permission.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>NestifyTech shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or services.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which NestifyTech operates.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>\n<p>We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(60,2,'Return & Refund Policy','return-refund-policy','<h2>Our 30-Day Return Policy</h2>\n<p>Your satisfaction is our priority. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you may return it within <strong>30 days</strong> of the delivery date for a full refund or exchange.</p>\n\n<h2>Eligibility for Returns</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Items must be in their original, unused condition</li>\n  <li>Items must be in the original packaging with all accessories included</li>\n  <li>Proof of purchase (order number or receipt) is required</li>\n  <li>Defective or damaged items qualify for free return shipping</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Software that has been activated or downloaded</li>\n  <li>Items marked as final sale or clearance</li>\n  <li>Consumables that have been opened</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How to Initiate a Return</h2>\n<ol>\n  <li>Contact our support team at <strong>returns@nestifytech.com</strong> with your order number</li>\n  <li>Our team will provide a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number</li>\n  <li>Pack the item securely and include your RMA number</li>\n  <li>Ship the item to the address provided by our support team</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Refund Processing</h2>\n<p>Once we receive and inspect the returned item (typically within 24–48 hours), your refund will be processed to your original payment method within <strong>3–7 business days</strong>.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(61,2,'Shipping Policy','shipping-policy','<h2>Shipping Options</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f3f4f6;\">\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:left;\">Service</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:left;\">Delivery Time</th>\n      <th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:left;\">Cost</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Standard Shipping</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">3–5 Business Days</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Free on orders over $50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Express Shipping</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">1–2 Business Days</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">$9.99</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Overnight Shipping</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Next Business Day</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">$19.99</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">International Shipping</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">7–14 Business Days</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Calculated at checkout</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Order Processing</h2>\n<p>Orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> of being placed (excluding weekends and public holidays). You will receive a confirmation email with tracking details once your order has been dispatched.</p>\n\n<h2>Order Tracking</h2>\n<p>Once your order ships, you will receive an email with a tracking number. You can track your order in real time from your <strong>Account Dashboard</strong> or via the carrier\'s website.</p>\n\n<h2>Shipping Restrictions</h2>\n<p>We currently ship to most countries worldwide. Some products may have shipping restrictions due to local regulations. If your country is not supported at checkout, please contact our support team.</p>\n\n<h2>Damaged or Lost Packages</h2>\n<p>If your package arrives damaged or is lost in transit, please contact us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of the expected delivery date. We will work with the carrier to resolve the issue promptly.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(62,2,'Contact Us','contact-us','<h2>We\'d Love to Hear From You</h2>\n<p>Whether you have a question about an order, need product advice, or want to partner with us — our team is ready to assist you around the clock.</p>\n\n<h2>Customer Support</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Email:</strong> support@nestifytech.com</li>\n  <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +1 (800) 123-4567</li>\n  <li><strong>Live Chat:</strong> Available on our website 24/7</li>\n  <li><strong>Support Hours:</strong> Monday – Sunday, 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM (EST)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Order Inquiries</h2>\n<p>For questions about an existing order — tracking, modifications, cancellations, or returns — please have your <strong>order number</strong> ready when you contact us for faster service.</p>\n\n<h2>Business & Partnership Inquiries</h2>\n<p>Interested in partnering with NestifyTech, becoming a reseller, or exploring wholesale opportunities? Reach out to our partnerships team at <strong>partners@nestifytech.com</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2>Our Head Office</h2>\n<p>\n  <strong>NestifyTech Inc.</strong><br>\n  123 Tech Boulevard, Suite 400<br>\n  San Francisco, CA 94105<br>\n  United States\n</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(63,2,'Cookie Policy','cookie-policy','<p><em>Last updated: October 13, 2026</em></p>\n\n<h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>\n<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help us remember your preferences, understand how you use our site, and improve your overall experience.</p>\n\n<h2>Types of Cookies We Use</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for the website to function properly (e.g., shopping cart, login sessions).</li>\n  <li><strong>Performance Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors interact with our site through analytics.</li>\n  <li><strong>Functionality Cookies:</strong> Remember your preferences such as language and currency.</li>\n  <li><strong>Marketing Cookies:</strong> Used to show you relevant advertisements based on your browsing behavior.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Managing Cookies</h2>\n<p>Most browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can choose to block or delete cookies, but doing so may affect the functionality of certain features on our website.</p>\n\n<h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>\n<p>We may use third-party services such as Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, and payment processors that also set their own cookies. These are governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>\n\n<h2>Contact Us</h2>\n<p>For questions about our cookie use, please contact us at <strong>privacy@nestifytech.com</strong>.</p>','publish','page','2026-10-13 04:41:48','2026-10-13 04:41:48'),(64,2,'How long does standard delivery take to arrive?','how-long-does-standard-delivery-take-to-arrive','<p>Standard shipping typically takes <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong> within the domestic region. If you need your order expedited, we offer Express Shipping (1-2 business days) options during checkout. Tracking is provided as soon as your parcel leaves our fulfillment center.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(65,2,'How can I track my shipment in real time?','how-can-i-track-my-shipment-in-real-time','<p>Once your order has been packed and handed over to our carrier, an automated confirmation email with your dedicated tracking number and link is sent to you. You can also view live delivery progress directly from your <strong>Account Dashboard</strong> under the \"Orders\" section.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(66,2,'Can I edit or cancel an order after placing it?','can-i-edit-or-cancel-an-order-after-placing-it','<p>To ensure lightning-fast dispatch, orders enter processing almost immediately. If you need to make corrections to your shipping address or cancel an item, please reach out to our 24/7 customer support within <strong>60 minutes</strong> of placing the order.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(67,2,'What payment methods and currencies do you support?','what-payment-methods-and-currencies-do-you-support','<p>We accept all major credit and debit cards including <strong>Visa, MasterCard, and American Express</strong>, along with PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Stripe secure checkout. All charges are securely processed in USD or your local detected currency.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(68,2,'Is my payment information and credit card data secure?','is-my-payment-information-and-credit-card-data-secure','<p>Absolutely. Every financial transaction is safeguarded by <strong>256-bit SSL encryption</strong> and processed through tier-1 PCI-DSS Level 1 compliant financial gateways. We never store, log, or share your sensitive credit card information on our servers.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(69,2,'What is your return and exchange policy?','what-is-your-return-and-exchange-policy','<p>We offer a straightforward <strong>30-day return policy</strong>. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you may return the item in its original condition and packaging for a full refund or replacement. Defective items qualify for complimentary return shipping.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(70,2,'How long does it take to receive my refund?','how-long-does-it-take-to-receive-my-refund','<p>Once your returned item arrives at our warehouse and passes quality inspection (usually within 24-48 hours), your refund will be processed back to your original payment method. Depending on your bank or card issuer, funds will appear in your statement within <strong>3 to 7 business days</strong>.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(71,2,'Do all electronic devices include a manufacturer warranty?','do-all-electronic-devices-include-a-manufacturer-warranty','<p>Yes! Every brand-new electronic device comes standard with a minimum <strong>1-year official manufacturer warranty</strong> covering hardware malfunctions and defects. You can also opt for extended protection warranties during checkout.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(72,2,'Are all products 100% authentic and genuine?','are-all-products-100-authentic-and-genuine','<p>We are an authorized direct partner and distributor for all brands featured in our store. Every product is <strong>100% genuine, brand new, factory sealed</strong>, and accompanied by authentic serial numbers and documentation.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(73,2,'How do I reset my password or recover my account?','how-do-i-reset-my-password-or-recover-my-account','<p>Click on the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login page, enter your registered email address, and you will immediately receive a secure password reset link. For any other login difficulties, our support team can verify your identity and restore access.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(74,2,'How can I contact customer service for help?','how-can-i-contact-customer-service-for-help','<p>Our support representatives are standing by 24/7. You can reach us via our live chat widget on the website, email us at <strong>support@nestifytech.com</strong>, or call our toll-free phone line at <strong>+1 (800) 123-4567</strong>.</p>','publish','faq','2026-10-13 04:42:09','2026-10-13 04:42:09'),(75,2,'Top 10 Flagship Smartphones to Watch in 2026','top-10-flagship-smartphones-2026','<p>The smartphone landscape has accelerated into an era of on-device neural processing, generative AI photography, and ultra-durable titanium architecture. In this comprehensive review, we look at the top 10 devices redefining what pocket computers can accomplish.</p><h2>1. On-Device Intelligence</h2><p>Rather than offloading every prompt to cloud data centers, flagship processors now run multi-billion-parameter language models natively. Voice assistants transcribe meetings instantaneously, translations happen offline, and photos are cleaned up in milliseconds.</p><h2>2. Next-Generation Display & Battery Efficiency</h2><p>With silicon-carbon battery cells entering mainstream production, thinner devices now pack 5,500mAh to 6,000mAh capacities without added bulk, easily delivering two full days of high-refresh usage.</p>','publish','blog','2026-10-02 04:43:28','2026-10-13 04:43:28'),(76,2,'Ultrabooks vs Gaming Laptops: Finding Your Perfect Balance','ultrabooks-vs-gaming-laptops-guide','<p>Modern computing hardware has narrowed the divide between extreme performance and featherweight form factors. However, thermal physics and battery chemistry still mean tradeoffs must be considered.</p><h2>Portability and All-Day Stamina</h2><p>For students, remote developers, and corporate travelers, high-density batteries combined with efficient ARM and modern x86 chips provide 15+ hours of real-world productivity without hunting for an outlet.</p><h2>Thermal Headroom for Creative Workloads</h2><p>When rendering 8K video, compiling massive codebases, or gaming at ultra settings, vapor chambers and dual-fan systems are indispensable.</p>','publish','blog','2026-10-02 04:44:08','2026-10-13 04:44:08'),(77,2,'How Spatial Audio and Lossless Codecs Transform Everyday Listening','spatial-audio-lossless-codecs-guide','<p>Audiophiles once dismissed wireless audio due to heavy compression and bandwidth constraints. Today, advanced Bluetooth codecs and low-latency planar drivers bring studio-grade sound directly to your daily commute.</p><h2>Understanding Bitrates and Dynamic Range</h2><p>Lossless transmission ensures subtle acoustic instruments and ambient reverbs are faithfully reproduced without digital artifacts or clipping.</p>','publish','blog','2026-10-02 04:44:08','2026-10-13 04:44:08'),(78,2,'Building an Intuitive Smart Home: Where to Begin','building-intuitive-smart-home-guide','<p>Smart homes used to mean juggling five different apps and hoping cross-brand integrations did not break after an update. With the widespread adoption of universal smart home standards, creating an effortless connected home is now accessible to everyone.</p><h2>Start with Smart Lighting and Power</h2><p>Automated dimming routines aligned with your circadian rhythm enhance sleep quality while smart plugs help eliminate phantom energy consumption.</p>','publish','blog','2026-10-02 04:44:08','2026-10-13 04:44:08');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `posts` ENABLE KEYS */;
